{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "eab375eef542472512728eb7a9f4db71c645566259fc03002712ec6a9110df42",
  "bundle_request_count": 21,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:061f7dd82088d0136bdba6a64022787735c4681e507d71d30b505b4f2dc1b1d8",
      "request_id": "061f7dd82088d0136bdba6a64022787735c4681e507d71d30b505b4f2dc1b1d8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d500423a89198dd45b7151b5248a4d93",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对伊埃拉，三比三之后，她连赢九局。整整一周，一盘未丢。她的第一个冠军，来得安静，又干脆。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5990708d6fa1f0f879d0f89bd7b43b2b29f9a6c0d2fdbfda6c86fe296ea6d388",
      "words_sha256": "6e9c230462f07cecfb3e6b34015e1e667a0e1513e4220886188c8399f089cbcc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1735dfa4241993e29eb71b828a55ee2659db620a7e31e184a794d501b345f918",
      "request_id": "1735dfa4241993e29eb71b828a55ee2659db620a7e31e184a794d501b345f918",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "144c964be642f8b0798f4628e480b61b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这个秋天，故事不只属于中国球员。福基纳来到成都之前，六次打进巡回赛决赛，只赢下一次；这一站，是他伤停两个半月后的复出第一站。决赛对胡尔卡奇，他先下一盘，第二盘，被拖进抢七。没人想到，这个抢七，会成为他整个中国赛季的转折点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "233fb4200a5fd16ef1907eab3b4091441b80f0b8367685d82f2e7c710fa0f31a",
      "words_sha256": "05ac5280dc165a8118cf289ee1d4f8b476bc876aac9ae63393601310fc6dc23a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:19525571e9197e9964f5e5335015e90d6b9946ed593818ca46696f0155a4bc78",
      "request_id": "19525571e9197e9964f5e5335015e90d6b9946ed593818ca46696f0155a4bc78",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f79dbbaea4e80d9831fb41e052c4ef69",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "宁波是另一个极端。世界第一莱巴金娜，决赛六比二、六比二，整场没有丢过一个发球局。这是她职业生涯第一次成功卫冕，也是她登顶世界第一之后，拿到的第一座冠军。宁波的八连胜，从去年一直续到今年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "73726f59baa41432173751a61af11353569c6359fbc2531bbe535c8885b6d9f1",
      "words_sha256": "e0352c3ae4872501a7369d02c824a44a8ef0752a6afac259b1e7edbaa6b43053"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:318c93cf1688da10ce3b1e2258d1692fb197b201b62994b3cba9c2b65b5af4ee",
      "request_id": "318c93cf1688da10ce3b1e2258d1692fb197b201b62994b3cba9c2b65b5af4ee",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "da5674e11ed2f57332d7b8898b63a6f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第三轮面对高芙，她一度在首盘五比四领先。那一周，她的排名从五百八十二位，一口气跳到四百一十八位。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "075d942d72dd7b55e714db7a6a9fad59969637b586544eb2f89aa5743fe785cc",
      "words_sha256": "8c6df4c887947e1a094eccbc39236f3829490d65f37f46a9d74dd3e1ed217517"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:332dac11e966f69803e930dc831a4d412d797a8852e624832bdc7ec2b58e1f59",
      "request_id": "332dac11e966f69803e930dc831a4d412d797a8852e624832bdc7ec2b58e1f59",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc4708a58760616b5da9ce596f24fd78",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "武汉的故事更安静。赫瓦林斯卡，半决赛掀翻斯瓦泰克，整场十九个制胜分，只送七个失误。决赛先丢一盘，又是逆转。她的职业生涯第一个冠军，直接是一千赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b980aae21661546fbcc10ad0cf6e8d3b85240ff05dc738706dbae612decad3c5",
      "words_sha256": "d7f1c4235f5111a96d40ae47850bf515eb5a7e457cdcac256cc149349ce860ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:52b07c19fb7735c12058c944b9f8460cb2ea0881ac604c64889f5ce682ca45de",
      "request_id": "52b07c19fb7735c12058c944b9f8460cb2ea0881ac604c64889f5ce682ca45de",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "704a3a3e65ee53ef2ae1b5876c5dbd07",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "杭州，梅德韦杰夫七比五、六比四赢下卢布列夫，二十三个 Ace，赛季第三冠。中国赛季的男单版图里，他是最稳的那一个。布云朝克特在四分之一决赛，输给萨菲乌林，没能更进一步。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "04348b611f839a30038575ab3388e19d4881f3da46bbc9f826f0e34ebc83cd64",
      "words_sha256": "6779fcc63b403c36c70ddfe48719a514bcb769503f51fbb913afe241c42bba53"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:55b2d9a6d2097c2c5a1dd29e1081784c39b0bd6581826be6a757748d9c8d099b",
      "request_id": "55b2d9a6d2097c2c5a1dd29e1081784c39b0bd6581826be6a757748d9c8d099b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4278dd290d3a05ee5deea76106377cec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘第十局，十五比四十，两个盘点压在头顶；平分之后，对手又拿到第三个。她一个一个全部救回，然后连赢十一分，顺手带走第一盘。排名第五十四位的外卡，站在她对面的，是世界前五的安德烈耶娃。整座钻石球场，先是鸦雀无声，然后炸开。第十一分，她用 Ace 收下首盘。五比四到七比五，一局球，改写了整场决赛的走向。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "081b6d7c7ea6002b23e9fa3e546a972c0aa820827cccb03e7e2c7765964f452c",
      "words_sha256": "138d107000b2b88854f83c92606201a6ea385b9d569a66631bee4a416f44d987"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6985218e2c5dc93fc3aedc98642d2d905e716c80210d5e43463a670da088c2b9",
      "request_id": "6985218e2c5dc93fc3aedc98642d2d905e716c80210d5e43463a670da088c2b9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3abfd83c779ca0412ea1b6f6988022f9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京属于德约科维奇。决赛首盘抢七拿下，第二盘，德米纳尔因伤退赛。三十四胜零负，第七座中网冠军，职业生涯第一百零二冠。十一年之后，他又站回了这里。可在半决赛，这座球场，刚刚见证过这个秋天最失控的一幕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "93c7146d105339527a3ab31346945cb636ef463d2c3beb8d321e9f31ba36a723",
      "words_sha256": "6f6a5e841dea11bfefb801d1f472cfd285148e4833ef672b427fdf4692fe8405"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8bfe6d12d5ae6d644958e91e67ebcd85eaf1900d4ae4025aae9348e747299c1d",
      "request_id": "8bfe6d12d5ae6d644958e91e67ebcd85eaf1900d4ae4025aae9348e747299c1d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "410a039eef7408b30898f49f636031e8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了上海，他已经在中国连赢九场。决赛先丢一盘，对手是二十岁的霍达尔，这是上海大师赛九年来，第一场全西班牙决赛。先丢一盘，抢七扳回，决胜盘咬住——他把这场决赛，打成了自己的履历：从不轻松，但从不放弃。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "32c841e0825a12c6c5809f47704fa05848fc4dbb1a86a796f1cc676b57f0c17d",
      "words_sha256": "0f55cf08209967e8eca94ca2dec1afb78ed391757a21ef8dc59905156570b8d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9515649948fd0f252c8fa1d0db495d55951fc8a5b30e13be013262fcee6fc8a5",
      "request_id": "9515649948fd0f252c8fa1d0db495d55951fc8a5b30e13be013262fcee6fc8a5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1096b280cf511bf80b3a374c1ca25dfe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "广州，对蒂莫费娃，决胜盘二比五。对方发球胜赛，赛点，就在眼前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0ba5c32a705173d634ea74d6c8977caefbe228e7ffe0a2806b5db38b473143de",
      "words_sha256": "28ddc783e7b03686677f12474278cf025eb0574a1f51a2ba1baa5597e6c09dbc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9a5254c6a8ae96227d0a9307764f22d57ed521371407d00cb397608392fe4a20",
      "request_id": "9a5254c6a8ae96227d0a9307764f22d57ed521371407d00cb397608392fe4a20",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e0ac5634a3cc9724062d6646b7a2df24",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六个星期，八座城市，九站比赛。二零二六年的中国赛季，从成都的秋雨，一直打到香港的海风。九站比赛，打出了五个首冠。有人在这里拿到职业生涯第一个冠军，有人在这里，把丢掉的东西重新赢了回来。这是一个关于「第一次」的故事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8305fb9a4ec29c48ba55e35197a26f9a08331d5b5268a9412faca1b91bc45880",
      "words_sha256": "63b116c436dd03f0d98890fdfd7aa5c01c2c958b46ab956c3ca08a071b0fa1dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b68b5d57d8109cb9e38f875878e9f1a59a57b81524266e84eaea75db43655152",
      "request_id": "b68b5d57d8109cb9e38f875878e9f1a59a57b81524266e84eaea75db43655152",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f540438dec26deda48debf932dae6176",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同样在北京，十六岁的孙心然，赢下了世界前五十的布克沙，全场只送出三个非受迫性失误。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "572080feb39a6de8ad41297dbb2504fba4f6a552b10bd64941f77e6a1a3752cd",
      "words_sha256": "341fffaf7ce43fb110ed85656649e83b013d927155cc3a69c1c67a3b933398c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c5d2d4990d15624973a91035c2372dc14e2e779b2dd1a7ae32a906846c1a5398",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c06029ec20be71966be4e3ed43ab95e3360ad417d23b9853774c45dc4ccc83b9",
      "request_id": "c06029ec20be71966be4e3ed43ab95e3360ad417d23b9853774c45dc4ccc83b9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "da40251e9f44b64e0125a5ad7805e3b5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九站，五个首冠？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8a8ca2240e27b6540ad781e1217440ffb30575e9e9556794f074a9b0c59fb31f",
      "words_sha256": "c8d43cf42208acf96e4f72a38e11960e2f457eb1ca3e8b8c0b32e80c85adfe19"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c329f5393d8f238730e0cbabe2951691a52a8e62fa4d169203441d5f6edcdb5f",
      "request_id": "c329f5393d8f238730e0cbabe2951691a52a8e62fa4d169203441d5f6edcdb5f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3d4e3dab66a09dc65b2ac0ca80a94f6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她救下赛点，一路追进抢七，七比三拿下。两个小时四十一分钟，第一次站进巡回赛四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "34b1d24d13fe7a182890462f06003d785be81eebd3abcc01f2055269301c14d3",
      "words_sha256": "7496972c60c2a69762f116cef72708ac63d0fe882fe22d13f5f64c6ff690b3f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c481ab363aaa4f476704898efaa1b1f51a11ff06a250391dce4116381b8c9c9b",
      "request_id": "c481ab363aaa4f476704898efaa1b1f51a11ff06a250391dce4116381b8c9c9b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0ba88e48c1176b68188da9fff2f61873",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可只要一发进区，她得分的把握就压过对手，二发也更稳。这不是一场靠发球赢的比赛，这是一场靠接发和底线，一分一分抠回来的比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c4d21bf0be05e39307ddaf8b272acaeac199d32472ee05dce747bfc4661dfbb6",
      "words_sha256": "facf357a7fb3fe42fc3335bbfc625a0c45165a165b6623368e242d1988456004"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d15c6300f74011c18546641407adf8656eef1ad3ca79bfbb38c481cd9f4da91d",
      "request_id": "d15c6300f74011c18546641407adf8656eef1ad3ca79bfbb38c481cd9f4da91d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fa81549610699ab25c2431f0d672bc3e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "刘婧文的秋天，是从一次退赛开始的。广州站，西尼亚科娃因伤退赛，她不战而胜进到四分之一决赛；最后捧杯的，是从资格赛打上来的达特。有时候，故事翻篇的方式，是先递给你一张轮空签，再看你接不接得住。广州她止步八强，没人记住她；香港，她要让所有人记住。一周后，她站到了决赛场上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e67e6afb2fd22b1cf8a8caddbe0f8f3e77e9f29f28d1160e41b8a8b035e605f9",
      "words_sha256": "b638b83fe77999281bb62c13cad5219f87dc425b4d61a805f014912bdba85e33"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dac2fa1b91d473db0f342ac59ad9712e61396db1cc3e59bacbf6289b2d0a7a49",
      "request_id": "dac2fa1b91d473db0f342ac59ad9712e61396db1cc3e59bacbf6289b2d0a7a49",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ae78acbe1fbc8d7c8ece06da7f1b60aa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七比五、六比四。二零一一年李娜之后，中国球员第二次，捧起一千赛的冠军奖杯。她等这一冠，等了将近两年：伤病、手术、复出，这个秋天，她在主场把答案写完了。郑钦文说，这是她职业生涯最重要的一场胜利。而这个秋天，属于中国球员的故事，才刚刚开始。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "96e6b7d469599ad5c63b9d6611702f8764e9d95d2b7442584215b1d774858a6f",
      "words_sha256": "fe2eab556adc27925f5fbb1231b9e572ff44cb99a573303a7e10d81397fc374a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dd6a29d0ee6d5ae5b791c3f9243d4ca2ea0005a40b1556c81fea035808037f7c",
      "request_id": "dd6a29d0ee6d5ae5b791c3f9243d4ca2ea0005a40b1556c81fea035808037f7c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f16fcc26dc530f8c4ddd172c9b937a6a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "九站比赛，九座冠军奖杯。这个秋天，有人从外卡打成冠军，有人把十连胜打成大师赛奖杯。有人决赛先丢一盘再逆转，还有人在退赛的阴影里，等来自己的第一冠。九站，五个首冠。郑钦文，福基纳，赫瓦林斯卡，孙心然。中国赛季的 MVP，你选谁？评论区，留下你的答案。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1090ce455502c6eb70a6620d9af98d9c7b0b4da682f3c67e18a1cc2375f87e98",
      "words_sha256": "83de5ebddf5a6e09af0278d93e2b7644fe5d5063b49202e56c492b01160ac326"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f14ed017d53387a1d91df04e4063dbcf605f00be5527db85b8d2da0cb07dc6f9",
      "request_id": "f14ed017d53387a1d91df04e4063dbcf605f00be5527db85b8d2da0cb07dc6f9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d55f2aad8ec52448104aa175c76c5664",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七局，他一度三比六落后。四个盘点，一个接一个，被他全部救了回来。成都的这个夜晚，从这一刻开始属于他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a888b1e4d8ae2d5348d16c03c08f36a1cd163beb0f36753b7444db9eddcfe9ac",
      "words_sha256": "0b2be94f3efbbe561b936785046655a852f4789863e7855ba722c590c0e173e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ffae231122ef645be916eafb8418eebc9fbb31c668801916378c6e8eb9dc748e",
      "request_id": "ffae231122ef645be916eafb8418eebc9fbb31c668801916378c6e8eb9dc748e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "727d988a9273121ddcea05547d424f33",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛夜，郑钦文的一发频频出界，整场都在和自己的一发较劲。她的 Ace，比对手还少三个。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "64e758bbeaabde8730be1f6fed253f73972d31dc6da3d96dfa9c91b67636d335",
      "words_sha256": "550f7039fd512988d4b9cd7a66f9d66acd9e995de4a12d30d3d3c0487486d8b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8305fb9a4ec29c48ba55e35197a26f9a08331d5b5268a9412faca1b91bc45880",
      "words_sha256": "63b116c436dd03f0d98890fdfd7aa5c01c2c958b46ab956c3ca08a071b0fa1dc",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e0ac5634a3cc9724062d6646b7a2df24",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六个星期，八座城市，九站比赛。二零二六年的中国赛季，从成都的秋雨，一直打到香港的海风。九站比赛，打出了五个首冠。有人在这里拿到职业生涯第一个冠军，有人在这里，把丢掉的东西重新赢了回来。这是一个关于「第一次」的故事。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "64e758bbeaabde8730be1f6fed253f73972d31dc6da3d96dfa9c91b67636d335",
      "words_sha256": "550f7039fd512988d4b9cd7a66f9d66acd9e995de4a12d30d3d3c0487486d8b9",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "727d988a9273121ddcea05547d424f33",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛夜，郑钦文的一发频频出界，整场都在和自己的一发较劲。她的 Ace，比对手还少三个。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c4d21bf0be05e39307ddaf8b272acaeac199d32472ee05dce747bfc4661dfbb6",
      "words_sha256": "facf357a7fb3fe42fc3335bbfc625a0c45165a165b6623368e242d1988456004",
      "words_path": "voice_03.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "0ba88e48c1176b68188da9fff2f61873",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可只要一发进区，她得分的把握就压过对手，二发也更稳。这不是一场靠发球赢的比赛，这是一场靠接发和底线，一分一分抠回来的比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "081b6d7c7ea6002b23e9fa3e546a972c0aa820827cccb03e7e2c7765964f452c",
      "words_sha256": "138d107000b2b88854f83c92606201a6ea385b9d569a66631bee4a416f44d987",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4278dd290d3a05ee5deea76106377cec",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "首盘第十局，十五比四十，两个盘点压在头顶；平分之后，对手又拿到第三个。她一个一个全部救回，然后连赢十一分，顺手带走第一盘。排名第五十四位的外卡，站在她对面的，是世界前五的安德烈耶娃。整座钻石球场，先是鸦雀无声，然后炸开。第十一分，她用 Ace 收下首盘。五比四到七比五，一局球，改写了整场决赛的走向。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "96e6b7d469599ad5c63b9d6611702f8764e9d95d2b7442584215b1d774858a6f",
      "words_sha256": "fe2eab556adc27925f5fbb1231b9e572ff44cb99a573303a7e10d81397fc374a",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ae78acbe1fbc8d7c8ece06da7f1b60aa",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七比五、六比四。二零一一年李娜之后，中国球员第二次，捧起一千赛的冠军奖杯。她等这一冠，等了将近两年：伤病、手术、复出，这个秋天，她在主场把答案写完了。郑钦文说，这是她职业生涯最重要的一场胜利。而这个秋天，属于中国球员的故事，才刚刚开始。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "572080feb39a6de8ad41297dbb2504fba4f6a552b10bd64941f77e6a1a3752cd",
      "words_sha256": "341fffaf7ce43fb110ed85656649e83b013d927155cc3a69c1c67a3b933398c3",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f540438dec26deda48debf932dae6176",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同样在北京，十六岁的孙心然，赢下了世界前五十的布克沙，全场只送出三个非受迫性失误。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "075d942d72dd7b55e714db7a6a9fad59969637b586544eb2f89aa5743fe785cc",
      "words_sha256": "8c6df4c887947e1a094eccbc39236f3829490d65f37f46a9d74dd3e1ed217517",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "da5674e11ed2f57332d7b8898b63a6f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第三轮面对高芙，她一度在首盘五比四领先。那一周，她的排名从五百八十二位，一口气跳到四百一十八位。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0ba5c32a705173d634ea74d6c8977caefbe228e7ffe0a2806b5db38b473143de",
      "words_sha256": "28ddc783e7b03686677f12474278cf025eb0574a1f51a2ba1baa5597e6c09dbc",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1096b280cf511bf80b3a374c1ca25dfe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "广州，对蒂莫费娃，决胜盘二比五。对方发球胜赛，赛点，就在眼前。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "34b1d24d13fe7a182890462f06003d785be81eebd3abcc01f2055269301c14d3",
      "words_sha256": "7496972c60c2a69762f116cef72708ac63d0fe882fe22d13f5f64c6ff690b3f3",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3d4e3dab66a09dc65b2ac0ca80a94f6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她救下赛点，一路追进抢七，七比三拿下。两个小时四十一分钟，第一次站进巡回赛四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "233fb4200a5fd16ef1907eab3b4091441b80f0b8367685d82f2e7c710fa0f31a",
      "words_sha256": "05ac5280dc165a8118cf289ee1d4f8b476bc876aac9ae63393601310fc6dc23a",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "144c964be642f8b0798f4628e480b61b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这个秋天，故事不只属于中国球员。福基纳来到成都之前，六次打进巡回赛决赛，只赢下一次；这一站，是他伤停两个半月后的复出第一站。决赛对胡尔卡奇，他先下一盘，第二盘，被拖进抢七。没人想到，这个抢七，会成为他整个中国赛季的转折点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a888b1e4d8ae2d5348d16c03c08f36a1cd163beb0f36753b7444db9eddcfe9ac",
      "words_sha256": "0b2be94f3efbbe561b936785046655a852f4789863e7855ba722c590c0e173e9",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d55f2aad8ec52448104aa175c76c5664",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七局，他一度三比六落后。四个盘点，一个接一个，被他全部救了回来。成都的这个夜晚，从这一刻开始属于他。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "32c841e0825a12c6c5809f47704fa05848fc4dbb1a86a796f1cc676b57f0c17d",
      "words_sha256": "0f55cf08209967e8eca94ca2dec1afb78ed391757a21ef8dc59905156570b8d5",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "410a039eef7408b30898f49f636031e8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了上海，他已经在中国连赢九场。决赛先丢一盘，对手是二十岁的霍达尔，这是上海大师赛九年来，第一场全西班牙决赛。先丢一盘，抢七扳回，决胜盘咬住——他把这场决赛，打成了自己的履历：从不轻松，但从不放弃。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b980aae21661546fbcc10ad0cf6e8d3b85240ff05dc738706dbae612decad3c5",
      "words_sha256": "d7f1c4235f5111a96d40ae47850bf515eb5a7e457cdcac256cc149349ce860ce",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc4708a58760616b5da9ce596f24fd78",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "武汉的故事更安静。赫瓦林斯卡，半决赛掀翻斯瓦泰克，整场十九个制胜分，只送七个失误。决赛先丢一盘，又是逆转。她的职业生涯第一个冠军，直接是一千赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "73726f59baa41432173751a61af11353569c6359fbc2531bbe535c8885b6d9f1",
      "words_sha256": "e0352c3ae4872501a7369d02c824a44a8ef0752a6afac259b1e7edbaa6b43053",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f79dbbaea4e80d9831fb41e052c4ef69",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "宁波是另一个极端。世界第一莱巴金娜，决赛六比二、六比二，整场没有丢过一个发球局。这是她职业生涯第一次成功卫冕，也是她登顶世界第一之后，拿到的第一座冠军。宁波的八连胜，从去年一直续到今年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "93c7146d105339527a3ab31346945cb636ef463d2c3beb8d321e9f31ba36a723",
      "words_sha256": "6f6a5e841dea11bfefb801d1f472cfd285148e4833ef672b427fdf4692fe8405",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3abfd83c779ca0412ea1b6f6988022f9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京属于德约科维奇。决赛首盘抢七拿下，第二盘，德米纳尔因伤退赛。三十四胜零负，第七座中网冠军，职业生涯第一百零二冠。十一年之后，他又站回了这里。可在半决赛，这座球场，刚刚见证过这个秋天最失控的一幕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "04348b611f839a30038575ab3388e19d4881f3da46bbc9f826f0e34ebc83cd64",
      "words_sha256": "6779fcc63b403c36c70ddfe48719a514bcb769503f51fbb913afe241c42bba53",
      "words_path": "voice_29.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "704a3a3e65ee53ef2ae1b5876c5dbd07",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "杭州，梅德韦杰夫七比五、六比四赢下卢布列夫，二十三个 Ace，赛季第三冠。中国赛季的男单版图里，他是最稳的那一个。布云朝克特在四分之一决赛，输给萨菲乌林，没能更进一步。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e67e6afb2fd22b1cf8a8caddbe0f8f3e77e9f29f28d1160e41b8a8b035e605f9",
      "words_sha256": "b638b83fe77999281bb62c13cad5219f87dc425b4d61a805f014912bdba85e33",
      "words_path": "voice_30.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fa81549610699ab25c2431f0d672bc3e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "刘婧文的秋天，是从一次退赛开始的。广州站，西尼亚科娃因伤退赛，她不战而胜进到四分之一决赛；最后捧杯的，是从资格赛打上来的达特。有时候，故事翻篇的方式，是先递给你一张轮空签，再看你接不接得住。广州她止步八强，没人记住她；香港，她要让所有人记住。一周后，她站到了决赛场上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5990708d6fa1f0f879d0f89bd7b43b2b29f9a6c0d2fdbfda6c86fe296ea6d388",
      "words_sha256": "6e9c230462f07cecfb3e6b34015e1e667a0e1513e4220886188c8399f089cbcc",
      "words_path": "voice_31.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d500423a89198dd45b7151b5248a4d93",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决赛对伊埃拉，三比三之后，她连赢九局。整整一周，一盘未丢。她的第一个冠军，来得安静，又干脆。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1090ce455502c6eb70a6620d9af98d9c7b0b4da682f3c67e18a1cc2375f87e98",
      "words_sha256": "83de5ebddf5a6e09af0278d93e2b7644fe5d5063b49202e56c492b01160ac326",
      "words_path": "voice_33.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f16fcc26dc530f8c4ddd172c9b937a6a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+18%",
